---
/** Slide 01 · Cover — internal operating doctrine. */
---

<section data-slot="01" data-variant="awm-p1" class="deck-section deck-glow" style="justify-content: space-between;">
  <header class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6">
    <span class="deck-eyebrow">Reach × Lossless · Internal Doctrine</span>
    <span class="deck-eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Agent Workflow Maxxing · Draft</span>
  </header>

  <div class="max-w-5xl">
    <p class="deck-eyebrow mb-5" style="color: var(--color-secondary);">The adoption decision</p>
    <h1 class="deck-h1">
      A team of three, <span class="deck-gradient">a very big surface.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="deck-lede mt-7">
      $19M to raise, dozens of funders to work, an August deadline. Agents
      research, draft, and watch; humans approve and act — covering the
      opportunity windows a small team can't reach manually.
    </p>
  </div>

  <footer class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6">
    <div class="deck-accent-bar"></div>
    <span class="deck-eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">scroll · arrow keys</span>
  </footer>
</section>
